# Marker file: this directory is the root of the DisloCluster repository.
#
# dislocluster/paths.py walks upward from its own location until it finds this
# file, so every script, module and notebook in the repo resolves the same
# REPO_ROOT no matter what the working directory is.
#
# Layout expected below this marker:
#   dislocluster/        the Python package (everything importable)
#   Simulations/         where simulations are run (input/, output/, notebooks)
#   ZrMicro/             0-D reduced cluster dynamics (C++ solver + build)
#   Gmsh/                simulation-domain meshing
#   MoDELib3/            3-D dislocation dynamics / spatially-resolved CD
#   Docs/                all documents
